        <definition>void EmacLitePhyDelay</definition>
        <argsstring>(unsigned int Seconds)</argsstring>
        <name>EmacLitePhyDelay</name>
        <param>
          <type>unsigned int</type>
          <declname>Seconds</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>For PPC we use a usleep call, for Microblaze we use an assembly loop that is roughly the same regardless of optimization level, although caches and memory access time can make the delay vary. </para>        </briefdescription>
